Package: pmsesampling
Title: Sample Size Determination for Predictive Models
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Louis", "Chen", email = "chenaters@gmail.com", role = c("aut","cre")),
    person("Zheyang", "Wu", email = "zheyangwu@wpi.edu", role = c("aut", "ths")))
Description: Provides analytic and empirical tools to estimate the minimum
    sample size required for achieving a target prediction mean-squared error
    (PMSE). Implements the nested ordinary least-squares criteria of Ma (2023)
    <https://digital.wpi.edu/downloads/0g354j58c> and reusable learning-curve
    tables for ridge, nearest-neighbor, and user-defined machine-learning
    models. Table reuse and a closed-form PMSE solution avoid repeated fitting
    and numerical root searches.
